The {{Term/Store|Royal Guard Set||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="CaC 190"/><ref name="TotK Piggyback 406"/> The Royal Guard Set goes unnamed in {{AoC}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Royal Guard Set is exclusive to {{TCB}} Downloadable Content Pack. It is a set of [[Armor]] originally worn by members of the [[Royal Guard]] that can be found as part of the "[[EX Royal Guard Rumors]]" [[Side Quest]]. It consists of the [[Royal Guard Cap]], the [[Royal Guard Uniform]] and the [[Royal Guard Boots]]. Wearing the full set confers the effects of [[Charge Atk. Stamina Up]], [[Swim Dash Stamina Up]], and [[Climb Jump Stamina Up]], with the [[Inventory]] only displaying Charge Atk. Stamina Up. These reduce the [[Stamina]] cost of charge attacks and jumping while climbing by 50%, and the cost of dashing or spin attacking while swimming by 75%. The Armor Set does not apply any other effects. It cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], nor can it be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]].

